{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「宇宙最強」甄子丹的太太汪詩詩，其模特兒出身的傲人身形向來遺傳自優良基因。日前，甄子丹與汪詩詩的21歲愛女甄濟如（Jasmine）在小紅書貼出短片，為外婆汪徐莉君（Jennifer）慶祝69歲生日，影片中汪媽媽的極致凍齡狀態震撼大批網民，高挑身材與美貌引爆話題。</p><figure><img alt=\"69歲狀態！（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184867406053773312501792.jpeg/cZPiyOi9v39wpEbpCgqUl1xPw8HApaesvsMMXr7DDF4\"/><figcaption>69歲狀態！（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"69歲狀態！（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184867403776135168126935.jpeg/zPE2BEZBHmzYMLk3CsU5SOI04pMvMzsN9xGfJfcRnyU\"/><figcaption>69歲狀態！（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"69歲狀態！（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184867401490108416875940.jpeg/6CnLq_QjBcvHoTZET1X3FytcB7yRSL0Se8gq63vIKus\"/><figcaption>69歲狀態！（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"69歲狀態！（小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184867399136972800840529.jpeg/z0Mx9qvPem5Va460Wx6bSw6ihE9S2RrqK8DB9SvAwfU\"/><figcaption>69歲狀態！（小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>穿吊帶裙展S曲線　氣場逼人如超模</p><p>甄濟如在小紅書以「介紹我美麗的外婆給大家！祝她生日快樂🎂」為題發文分享影片。影片中的汪徐莉君雖然已步入69歲，但保養功力極為驚人。她身穿一條修身吊帶裙亮相，不僅身材高挑纖細、完全沒有贅肉，更展現出勻稱流暢的完美曲線，穿起性感吊帶裙毫無違和感。片中她舉手投足間盡顯優雅溫婉的貴婦氣質，面容皮膚緊緻白滑，氣場絲毫不輸給模特兒出身的女兒汪詩詩與外孫女甄濟如。</p><figure><img alt=\"超級凍齡！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184867703509618688504197.jpeg/LrJx-J6RUIPjpFm6nG4JVnGUbH5cRXE2pt59OabefTk\"/><figcaption>超級凍齡！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"超級凍齡！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184867701139705856451726.jpeg/wmD53gC6ghMM5Vpkuh7BkyjgeBiVsNP45x9tHecfbR0\"/><figcaption>超級凍齡！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"超級凍齡！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184867698715267072817504.jpeg/EFDX2YZDAMRy_TBahsnlD37bZ01XUO_8J6HSCieh0go\"/><figcaption>超級凍齡！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"超級凍齡！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184867696173387776256910.jpeg/Pdnvb2hkG_rGJ7s9y3bGFy4oTgzAopW9PTXoQT016EE\"/><figcaption>超級凍齡！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>只大女婿甄子丹5歲　網民激讚與甄濟如「猶如母女」</p><p>事實上，汪徐莉君的超強凍齡狀態早已多次引發熱議。現年64歲的甄子丹僅比岳母小約5歲，但汪媽媽每次公開亮相都保養得宛如女婿同輩。這次在影片中與外孫女甄濟如同框，兩人互動自然親密，凍齡模樣更讓大批網民驚呼兩人完全不似兩隔代的祖孫，反而「猶如母女」。不少網民看過影片後紛紛留言激讚：「這哪裡像69歲？」、「與Jasmine同框根本是母女吧」、「身材高挑又有氣質，簡直是超模級外婆」、「一家三代基因太強大了」。</p><figure><img alt=\"汪詩詩同汪圓圓去年為媽媽慶生。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251008/1052602662975049728641820.jpeg/u1S7aoslxNXv5WYPPejNTRPQuoKLrW2Nw-XVwsPl1cI\"/><figcaption>汪詩詩同汪圓圓去年為媽媽慶生。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"汪媽媽與細女汪圓圓同女婿蔡加讚。（IG@jenniferlijunwang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251008/1052602659678195712192356.jpeg/-0ccO3l6HqoALZZxQDdM1jOpEzGDZOBMbQZeqW0GXqk\"/><figcaption>汪媽媽與細女汪圓圓同女婿蔡加讚。（IG@jenniferlijunwang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"凍齡有術！（IG@jenniferlijunwang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230816/768560181419315200018672.jpeg/G5j-02p2Q7nwQAnKyQWG312ezlczRV3PMGyh3TBsod0\"/><figcaption>凍齡有術！（IG@jenniferlijunwang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"凍齡有術！（IG@jenniferlijunwang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251008/1052602953111703552621579.jpeg/BEB6VS0dqgh2OtnEg8ne4jUxVjr0XBwJYRKv3GESr9w\"/><figcaption>凍齡有術！（IG@jenniferlijunwang）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T02:20:04.926197+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":773,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}